Z||000000||jarrodatt||07-04-2001||12:27 AM||||any one have a good v6 and kit or what ever i can change out in a 85 2.5l se? how hard is it or will i need any thing else?||||reg||1
Z||000001||isthiswhereiputausername?||07-04-2001||04:05 PM||||It depends on if you want the carb or fuel injected motor..<P>carbed? just motor mounts,exhaust and some wiring splicing..<P>FI? motor mounts,exhaust,computer,wiring harness from the engine compartment is all thats needed I think.<P><BR>I swapped mine to a 2.8 carbed and love it.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||88formula||07-04-2001||04:51 PM||||Kick Hill Farm does. <A HREF="http://www.kickhill.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kickhill.com/</A> <P><BR>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG">   <P><p>[This message has been edited by 88formula (edited 07-04-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||mrfiero||07-04-2001||04:58 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by jarrodatt:<BR><B>any one have a good v6 and kit or what ever i can change out in a 85 2.5l se? how hard is it or will i need any thing else?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Alright!!  Another Coloradoan!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I will be moving back to Greeley next month to finish my degree (12 years in the making).<P>At any rate......adding a V-6 to your coupe isn't too difficult if you have a donor Fiero to pull the parts off of.  Is your SE an auto. or stick?<P>I actually have a wrecked '85 SE with a V-6 and 4-sp. that I'm about to scrap.  If you want it I could sell it to you for a song.  The engine is partially stripped, so you'd have to come up with a running motor, but you would have EVERYTHING else needed to accomplish the swap.<P>I could even help you out when I can.  LMK......I plan on hauling the SE away this week.<P>    ||||reg||1
Z||000004||The Fieromaster||07-04-2001||05:14 PM||||It is easy to do... All the mount locations are all there... just get a Fiero motor (with al mounts) and wiring harness (and computer) and its all plug and play... We are doing one now but its starting to suck only becasue there has been alotta things involved causeing the bds.... look for a post on that later  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      "Raced That Wrecked Better"<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">    <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
